# python
# The asset pipeline is a pile of scripts in tools/, and every run leaves compiled
# bytecode behind. 29 .pyc files were tracked, so any commit that touched a generator
# also carried a binary blob nobody reads and that conflicts on every merge.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
